mode: "100644"
text: "# The VIBES framework — participate in culture without the cringe\n\nMeme-done-wrong > no meme. VIBES is two creative steps wrapped in three hard gates. The agent **advises +\nwrites the copy/concept**; the **human/creator makes the asset + adds the final wit + sensitivity pass**;\n**WoopSocial publishes/schedules** (reactive ones often posted in the moment).\n\n## V — Verify you understand the format\n- Know the **origin, meaning + connotations** before touching it (sketchy origins → backlash). If you have to\n  **explain** the joke, it's dead. If you have to ask **\"is this still cool?\"**, it isn't.\n\n## I — Is it on-brand?\n- The **fit filter:** does it match the **voice/audience/values**? **\"Would it work without your logo?\"**\n  **Niche/hyper-specific beats broad.** Off-brand/forced = worse than nothing.\n\n## B — Brand-safety lines\n- **Never** tragedies, sensitive topics, divisive politics, private moments, **appropriation**, or **punching\n  down.** Research the origin. **Participation, not exploitation.** **If you have to ask, don't.**\n\n## E — Earn the rights\n- **Make ORIGINAL meme visuals** (AI + human pass / custom photo / commissioned) to dodge copyright; **no\n  copyrighted characters or celebrity likeness without permission**; mind **trademarked** catchphrases;\n  **trending audio is risky for brands** → `ai-music-and-sound`. The asset → `image-prompt`/\n  `design-and-templates`.\n\n## S — Ship it native + fast, or sit it out\n- **Lo-fi + authentic**, not corporate; the **human adds the final wit + sensitivity pass** (AI is a start);\n  **speed** matters (cut approvals; → `trend-jacking`). But if it **doesn't fit or you're late → sit it out.**\n  WoopSocial publishes/schedules.\n\n## The go / no-go a request should clear\n```\nFORMAT: origin + meaning understood? not reliant on explaining? still live (not peaked)?\nFIT: matches voice/audience/values? works without the logo? niche enough?\nSAFETY: no tragedy/sensitive/divisive/private/appropriation/punching-down? origin clean?  (\"if you have to ask, don't\")\nIP: original visual (not a copyrighted character/celeb)? trending audio cleared? credit the creator?\nSHIP: lo-fi + native? human wit + sensitivity pass done? fast enough? -> if any gate fails, sit it out.\n```\n"
